  "question": {
    "text": "The range of the function <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> (where, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mo>&#183;</mo></mfenced></math> is the greatest integer function) is"
